      "claim": "The bundle's traffic advisory, EV-ADVIS-00529-01, has admissibility status MISSING with weight_multiplier 0.0, and I disclose that plainly: it carries no payload and can establish no fact; its only citable content is its own absence. That absence does not escalate this case. POL-RD-13(1) provides that where the asserting party names no evidence ID for an advisory the absence is a gap in the bundle rather than a contradiction in it, and no party here invokes POL-RD-03 on the driver's side - the driver's answer is that the threshold was never crossed, not that traffic excused a crossing. POL-RD-10(5) is therefore not triggered by this artifact, and no exculpatory clause has been invoked against a cited artifact that is missing from the pool.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-00529-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
